main.content:
Small Icon only template; creates an inline checkbox:

Syntax:
* {{t|Checkbox|yes/partial/unsure/no|text}}

Options:
* {{Checkbox|yes}} Checked
* {{Checkbox|partial}} Partially-checked
* {{Checkbox|unsure}} Unsure
* {{Checkbox|no}} Un-checked

Or supply text, and the checks will be listed:
{{checkbox|yes|Naxxramas}}
{{checkbox|partial|Deadmines}}
{{checkbox|unsure|Uldaman}}
{{checkbox|no|Uldman}}

and text with links:
{{checkbox|yes|[[Naxxramas]]}}
{{checkbox|partial|[[Deadmines]]}}
{{checkbox|unsure|[[Uldman]]}}
{{checkbox|no|[[Uldaman]]}}

Default:
* {{Checkbox}}<noinclude>

[[Category:Template documentation]]</noinclude>

Use to show the reaction of an NPC to a particular faction.

